@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@venueId = 1
@reservationId = 1

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### List venues
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/venues

### Venue details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/venues/{{venueId}}

### Create venue
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/venues
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"第三会议室","location":"教学楼 A303","capacity":20,"openingTime":"08:00","closingTime":"22:00","status":"OPEN"}

### Create reservation (copy the returned id into reservationId above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"venueId":{{venueId}},"organizer":"云原生小组","reservationDate":"2026-11-01","startTime":"10:00","endTime":"11:00","purpose":"实验讨论"}

### Reservation list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations?venueId={{venueId}}&date=2026-11-01&status=ACTIVE

### Reservation details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}

### Cancel reservation (retains history)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}/cancel

### DELETE is also a logical cancellation
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}
